Z||000000||Huck||02-26-2001||10:02 PM||||I've been hanging out around this board for a few weeks, and have started posting in the last week or so, but have never really properly introduced myself!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>My name's Mark, or Huck.. whichever you prefer. I'm 22, from Chesley Ontario (you guys are probably more fimaliar with Walkerton Ontario E. Coli capital) - just a few miles away.  I have had 2 fiero's so far, an 86 coupe, and now an 87 GT T-top.<P>Here's a few pics:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://content.communities.msn.ca/isapi/fetch.dll?action=view_photo&ID_Community=MarkDriedger&ID_Topic=2&ID_Message=6"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://content.communities.msn.ca/isapi/fetch.dll?action=view_photo&ID_Community=MarkDriedger&ID_Topic=2&ID_Message=7"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://content.communities.msn.ca/isapi/fetch.dll?action=view_photo&ID_Community=MarkDriedger&ID_Topic=2&ID_Message=9"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://content.communities.msn.ca/isapi/fetch.dll?action=view_photo&ID_Community=MarkDriedger&ID_Topic=2&ID_Message=10"> <P>Future projects of mine include a spoiler (whale tail Im thinking) New Paint all around (my car was keyed, then a 4x4 truck backed into me and put a nice hole in the front facia), and finish my interior.<P>What do you guys think about tints? I will be tinting, but I dunno if I want black, or silver yet.. would that be too much silver?  Also, some new chrome rims  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>What I have right now: T-tops, painted interior, computer chip, lowered 2", 50 series directional tires.<P>Thanks for takin the time to get to know me, I hope to be an active member in times to come..<P>Huc||||reg||4
Z||000001||sqoach||02-26-2001||10:09 PM||||pretty nice. so, what happened to the coupe?<P>if it was me, i would go with normal tint, paint it the same color, but paint the trim black, and get silver wheels, not chrome. chrome would look kinda weird i think. there's someone on the forum that has a silver fastback gt with silver rims and it looks sweet.<P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig2.JPG"> <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||1
Z||000002||Huck||02-26-2001||10:39 PM||||The coupe?  I got it when I was 16.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  It saw some rough days...  I got rear ended in it May of 99... I was tailgating in the rain the lady in front of me locked up her brakes,  went sideways in front of me on an overpass over Hwy 400 in Barrie.  I manuvered around her, but the guy in the 80's 5.0L behind me did the same thing as me, but lost control and nailed me.  Then 2 months later I ran a red light in Orangeville and T-Boned a Dodge Caravan.  Had 172,000km on it, sold it to a friend for $1500...  Was Fieroless for a year before I found another one that was what I was looking for.<P>Now that Im a little older and have my 1st crackup behind me, hopefully I can keep this one looking and riding respectable||||reg||1
